  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Partnership support in Ukraine</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Ukraina inom Global Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Hitta projekt tillsammans med andra l&#xe4;nder f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra den radiologiska s&#xe4;kerheten i Ukraina</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participate with other countries to find relevant projects to strengthen radiation safety</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till ukrainska intressenter f&#xf6;r deltagande i ISI-m&#xf6;ten (Information Sharing Initiative) tv&#xe5; g&#xe5;nger om &#xe5;ret, i syfte att rapportera och samordna aktiviteter relaterade till str&#xe5;ls&#xe4;kerhetsfr&#xe5;gor i Ukraina med andra givarl&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Ukrainian stakeholders for participation in ISI (Information Sharing Initiative) meetings two times a year, with the aim to report and coordinate activities related to nuclear and radiological safety and security issues in Ukraine with other donors countries.</narrative>
  </description>
